<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>OpenCV原生依赖的静态装配与候选身份</title><style>body{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:24px;background:#101a29;color:#e3edf8;font:15px/1.7 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}a{color:#96d1ff}p,small{color:#b0c6dc}.notice{background:#1c2d43;border-left:4px solid #dfb16e;padding:15px}details{background:#17273c;padding:14px;border:1px solid #3f5671;margin:14px 0}summary{cursor:pointer}.unknown{border-color:#d299ac}pre{font:12px/1.6 Consolas,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#0b1524;padding:12px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style><a href="index.html">← 架构索引</a> · <a href="export-text-rendering-audit.html#T10">导出文字的PInvoke边界</a><h1>OpenCV原生依赖的静态装配与候选身份</h1><p class="notice">原Main→包装静态初始化→目录/架构分支→Win32 LoadLibrary声明；三候选仅核PE身份和五个选定导出。实际装载路径仍未知，未执行厂商或native。</p><p><a href="rendering-native-loader-audit.json">完整专题JSON</a> · <a href="rendering-native-loader-audit.cil.json">独立CIL</a> · <a href="rendering-native-loader-audit.pe.json">PE表和静态路径代入</a></p><nav><a href="#L01">L01</a> · <a href="#L02">L02</a> · <a href="#L03">L03</a> · <a href="#L04">L04</a> · <a href="#L05">L05</a> · <a href="#L06">L06</a> · <a href="#L07">L07</a> · <a href="#L08">L08</a> · <a href="#L09">L09</a> · <a href="#L10">L10</a> · <a href="#L11">L11</a> · <a href="#L12">L12</a> · <a href="#U01">U01</a></nav><details id="L01" class="source-confirmed"><summary>L01 · 原VisionMaster.exe PE/CLI入口 → x64原件与Main的cwd设置 · source-confirmed</summary><p>原EXE静态身份为PE32+ machine0x8664，CLI il-only，入口token0x0600010a。原Program.Main先Directory.SetCurrentDirectory(AppDomain.CurrentDomain.BaseDirectory)，再按IsMultiApp选择StartApp/SingleInstance路径；StartApp构造App并Run。该静态cwd赋值不证明之后进程cwd、环境或已装载模块状态未变化。</p><p>待核：没有启动原EXE；宿主实际BaseDirectory/cwd/架构环境值未采集。</p><details><summary>VisionMaster.Program::Main · 163–182</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/rendering-native-loader-audit.cil.json · original-managed-cil · SHA 6fb283895af9aae658a8942ead14ce40eb9f68b89c82f21a976ba02a365779f3</code></p><pre>          &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x0600010a&quot;,
          &quot;symbol&quot;: {
            &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x0600010a&quot;,
