              &quot;opcode&quot;: &quot;nop&quot;,</pre></details><details><summary>VisionMaster.Program::StartApp · 519–538</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/rendering-native-loader-audit.cil.json · original-managed-cil · SHA 6fb283895af9aae658a8942ead14ce40eb9f68b89c82f21a976ba02a365779f3</code></p><pre>          &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x0600010b&quot;,
