              &quot;opcode&quot;: &quot;nop&quot;,</pre></details><details><summary>Original EXE PE identity · 33–44</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/rendering-native-loader-audit.exe-identity.json · original-managed-metadata · SHA 7dad9f7e7fb8842e6c2a26a8df44b966132520cec933c83f94657ec2adf49466</code></p><pre>      &quot;machine_hex&quot;: &quot;0x8664&quot;,
