          &quot;il-only&quot;</pre></details></details><details id="L02" class="source-confirmed"><summary>L02 · 原EXE旁exe.config → CLR配置中的目录声明与文件来源 · source-confirmed</summary><p>原件旁exe.config声明v4.0/.NETFramework4.6.1，assemblyBinding下probing privatePath含3rdLib/OpenCv、myLibs、PublicFile/x64等；选定原旁文件与已有本地app.config逐字节相符。所选WindowsLibraryLoader方法没有读取这个probing字符串，不能把它直接当作LoadLibraryRaw的传入目录列表。</p><p>待核：不能由CLR配置的静态目录声明确定NativeMethods实际绑定到哪份包装程序集或native文件。</p><details><summary>Original sidecar probing · 151–151</summary><p><code>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/VisionMaster.exe.config · shipped-sidecar-configuration · SHA 9c5dbc6b41d66ec4e902400299808f5a68356fe35438fbc621444b053f4fea9d</code></p><pre>      &lt;probing privatePath=&quot;3rdLib;3rdLib\System;3rdLib\NPOI;myLibs;myLibs\Hik.VM.CodeBuild;3rdLib\MsgPack;3rdLib\OpenCv;3rdLib\ICSharpCode;GateWay;3rdLib\VisionDesigner.NET;PublicFile\x64;PublicFile\x64\QtPlugins;PublicFile\x64\QtPlugins\imageformats;PublicFile\x64\QtPlugins\platforms;3rdLib\OxyPlot;3rdLib\MVD;&quot; /&gt;</pre></details><details><summary>Original supported runtime · 135–135</summary><p><code>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/VisionMaster.exe.config · shipped-sidecar-configuration · SHA 9c5dbc6b41d66ec4e902400299808f5a68356fe35438fbc621444b053f4fea9d</code></p><pre>    &lt;supportedRuntime version=&quot;v4.0&quot; sku=&quot;.NETFramework,Version=v4.6.1&quot; /&gt;</pre></details></details><details id="L03" class="source-confirmed"><summary>L03 · NativeMethods.cctor → 空依赖数组→LoadLibraries→TryPInvoke · source-confirmed</summary><p>原静态初始化将tried=false，RuntimeDllNames与OpenCVDllNames均初始化空数组，配置两个错误回调，然后LoadLibraries(WindowsLibraryLoader.Instance.AdditionalPaths)，之后才TryPInvoke。这不是执行加载的证据；LoadLibraries中的redirectError若先抛出，也不能说之后TryPInvoke已执行。</p><p>待核：静态初始化实际触发时机/线程、类型初始化失败和重试行为未运行；其它代码是否修改可变AdditionalPaths另留未知。</p><details><summary>OpenCvSharp.NativeMethods::.cctor · 909–928</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/rendering-native-loader-audit.cil.json · original-managed-cil · SHA 6fb283895af9aae658a8942ead14ce40eb9f68b89c82f21a976ba02a365779f3</code></p><pre>          &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x0600151b&quot;,
          &quot;symbol&quot;: {
            &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x0600151b&quot;,
            &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;method-def&quot;,
            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;OpenCvSharp.NativeMethods&quot;,
            &quot;name&quot;: &quot;.cctor&quot;,
            &quot;parameters&quot;: 0,
            &quot;attributes&quot;: &quot;Private, Static, HideBySig, SpecialName, RTSpecialName, HasSecurity&quot;,
            &quot;signatureBytes&quot;: &quot;000001&quot;
          },
