            {
              &quot;offset&quot;: 0,
              &quot;label&quot;: &quot;IL_0000&quot;,
              &quot;opcode&quot;: &quot;ldc.i4.0&quot;,</pre></details><details><summary>OpenCvSharp.NativeMethods · 4901–4921</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/export-text-rendering-audit.resources/OpenCvSharp.NativeMethods.decompiled.cs · original-managed-offline-ilspy-decompilation · SHA e3d29507c7ac7c97f8f4b283df9f552107bc633d83501af3553bc73c8ec5d081</code></p><pre>	static NativeMethods()
	{
		tried = false;
		RuntimeDllNames = new string[0];
		OpenCVDllNames = new string[0];
		ErrorHandlerThrowException = (ErrorCode status, string funcName, string errMsg, string fileName, int line, IntPtr userdata) =&gt;
		{
			try
			{
				int num = 0;
			}
			finally
			{
				throw new OpenCVException(status, funcName, errMsg, fileName, line);
			}
		};
		ErrorHandlerIgnorance = (ErrorCode status, string funcName, string errMsg, string fileName, int line, IntPtr userdata) =&gt; 0;
		LoadLibraries(WindowsLibraryLoader.Instance.AdditionalPaths);
		TryPInvoke();
	}
</pre></details></details><details id="L04" class="source-confirmed"><summary>L04 · NativeMethods.LoadLibraries → 非Unix平台的预加载顺序与redirectError · source-confirmed</summary><p>IsUnix把Unix/MacOSX/128视为Unix，其它走Windows分支。additionalPaths null变空数组；运行库搜索列表另加System目录，OpenCV模块用名称+400，而Extern用原additionalPaths数组。所选静态初始化两依赖数组为空，故所见初值对应枚举无元素，但Extern.LoadLibrary与后续redirectError仍在直线路径。没有把System目录自动加到Extern显式附加路径。</p><p>待核：数组后续是否被外部反射改写或环境特殊平台不推断；redirectError本体native未执行。</p><details><summary>OpenCvSharp.NativeMethods::LoadLibraries · 1191–1210</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/rendering-native-loader-audit.cil.json · original-managed-cil · SHA 6fb283895af9aae658a8942ead14ce40eb9f68b89c82f21a976ba02a365779f3</code></p><pre>          &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x0600151c&quot;,
          &quot;symbol&quot;: {
            &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x0600151c&quot;,
            &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;method-def&quot;,
            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;OpenCvSharp.NativeMethods&quot;,
            &quot;name&quot;: &quot;LoadLibraries&quot;,
