	private static extern IntPtr Win32LoadLibrary(string dllPath);</pre></details></details><details id="L09" class="source-confirmed"><summary>L09 · TryPInvoke与PInvokeHelper.CreateException → tried门与有限首次探测 · source-confirmed</summary><p>TryPInvoke若tried已true早退；先将tried=true再调用core_Mat_sizeof。DllNotFound与BadImageFormat分别包装成OpenCvSharpException（保留inner），尝试Console输出后抛包装异常；其它异常记录inner或自身消息再throw。它不验证core_putTextZh或OutputArray出口，且运行前LoadLibraries的redirectError可能已先触发PInvoke。</p><p>待核：未实际运行探测，不把tried当作已成功装载/可调用全部出口的状态。</p><details><summary>OpenCvSharp.NativeMethods::TryPInvoke · 1886–1905</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/rendering-native-loader-audit.cil.json · original-managed-cil · SHA 6fb283895af9aae658a8942ead14ce40eb9f68b89c82f21a976ba02a365779f3</code></p><pre>          &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x0600151e&quot;,
